<title>MALAYSIA: SOCCER-RESULTS OF WORLD CUP ASIAN ZONE GROUP ONE QUALIFIERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RESULTS OF WORLD CUP ASIAN ZONE GROUP ONE QUALIFIERS.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of World Cup Asian</p>
<p>zone group one qualifying matches on Sunday:</p>
<p>Saudi Arabia 2 Taiwan 0 (halftime 2-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Ibrahim al-Shahrani 38, Obied al-Dosary 45</p>
<p>Malaysia 2 Bangladesh 0 (Halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Azman Adnan 43, Idris Karim 80.</p>
</text>
